WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.232
Wide form is useful when the categories are stable and the main goal is side by side comparison.

00:00:08.232 --> 00:00:14.602
For example, a report may always show January, February, and March in separate columns.

00:00:14.602 --> 00:00:20.002
A grade matrix may always show a small fixed list of courses.

00:00:20.002 --> 00:00:27.199
Wide form is easy for people to scan, but it becomes harder to maintain when categories change frequently.
